  m_Name: NoteData_RosettaStone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  statueName: The Rosetta Stone
  pages:
  - 'This is the Rosetta Stone!

    It is one of the most important

    objects
    ever found.


    It has the SAME message written

    in THREE different languages,

    one
    of them is ancient hieroglyphics!'
  - "For a long time, nobody could read\nthe mysterious picture-writing of Egypt.\n\nBut
    when they found this stone\nin a town called Rashid (Rosetta),\nthey finally
    cracked the code!\n\nNow we can read what the ancient\nEgyptians wrote thousands
    of years ago.\nIsn't that amazing?  \U0001F511"
